ion-radio-show-533.jpg","content":"Rich Medina brings the funk to close out 2021.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-12-18T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Rich Medina's Session","position":0}},{"id":"sTZMCQvwG5Y","position":15,"timestamp":"00:43:45","rawTrack":"Nas - Still Dreaming (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"koxNPyKhHHY","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/still-dreaming-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"still-dreaming-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Still Dreaming (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"3HWRjhkV2I8","slug":"550","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-550/ra.1623918210","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-550"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #550","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-550.jpg","content":"Joe Kay goes through all of his favorite slowed edit tracks.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"zzAwb_12aSg","position":32,"timestamp":"01:09:59","rawTrack":"Nas - If I Ruled the World (Imagine That) [feat. Lauryn Hill]","track":{"id":"FrVH6XWd-q8","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/if-i-ruled-the-world-imagine-that-feat-lauryn-hill/","slug":"if-i-ruled-the-world-imagine-that-feat-lauryn-hill","title":"If I Ruled the World (Imagine That) [feat. Lauryn Hill]","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/if-i-ruled-the-world-imagine-that-feat-lauryn-hill.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Mw4mBRRhFsc","slug":"414","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-414/ra.1470719147","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-414"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #414","artwork":"images/episodes/414.png","content":"\nMusic from Daniel Caesar and Freddie Gibbs & Madlib\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-06-29T10:06:55+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"6dFGLKdpKBY","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - Oochie Wally (instrumental)","track":{"id":"f4bBv6FeVTM","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/oochie-wally-instrumental/","slug":"oochie-wally-instrumental","title":"Oochie Wally (instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/oochie-wally-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Colta's Set","position":1}},{"id":"-NDrz3mYnqs","position":53,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - U Owe Me (Sango Edit)","track":{"id":"D4wQma7Esf0","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/u-owe-me-sango-edit/","slug":"u-owe-me-sango-edit","title":"U Owe Me (Sango Edit)","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/u-owe-me-sango-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9vaV0x1cIVc","slug":"152","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-152-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #152 w/ LIKE (Pac Div)","artwork":"/images/episodes/152.jpg","content":"\n\nDue to all the adversity we went through with this show we had [LIKE](https://soundcloud.com/callmelike) play music past the last hour and extend all the way for a total of 3 hours & 39 minutes. \n<!--more-->\n\nFrom the very first minute to the very end we were providing music that you never heard of or forgot about, configuring wires, figuring out audio issues, chopping it up about food, you name it. So much effort went into producing this show. We want to thank our brother LIKE for rolling through and blessing us with a proper DJ set, freestyle over Esta's beat, and talking to us about his experiences growing up and being in Pac Div. This man has traveled the world, played alongside the best in the game, and has also produced for/with the best (Kendrick, The Neptunes, ect). Joe Kay made sure to touch on topics that are very insightful. LIKE will be releasing with us on Soulection so stay tuned! \n\nFollow LIKE on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Callmelike) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clearlyitslike/) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/callmeLike/)\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":13189,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"LIKE's Set","position":1}},{"id":"zA0vm2nHLEs","position":59,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - The Don","track":{"id":"BF9ihwVBOwA","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/the-don/","slug":"the-don","title":"The Don","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/the-don.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"w1D6_4BF4tY","position":70,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - 2nd Childhood","track":{"id":"cnx7_Oqdm14","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/2nd-childhood/","slug":"2nd-childhood","title":"2nd Childhood","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/2nd-childhood.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-03T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"0SvhtxtrZCM","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - 2nd Childhood","track":{"id":"cnx7_Oqdm14","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/2nd-childhood/","slug":"2nd-childhood","title":"2nd Childhood","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/2nd-childhood.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JzAXADeB_WI","slug":"200","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-200-celebration-of-life"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #200 (Celebration of Life)","artwork":"/images/episodes/200.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11158,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-01-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"eFhys0RdWZs","position":28,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - Purple","track":{"id":"Zc10f5ONack","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/purple/","slug":"purple","title":"Purple","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artwork":"images/artists/nas/tracks/purple.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JzAXADeB_WI","slug":"200","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-200-celebration-of-life"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #200 (Celebration of Life)","artwork":"/images/episodes/200.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11158,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-01-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"xIuFHcxkP_o","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Nas - Still Dreaming","track":{"id":"r96kWjKKAqs","path":"/artists/nas/tracks/still-dreaming/","slug":"still-dreaming","title":"Still Dreaming","artist":{"slug":"nas","title":"Nas"},"artw